{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-ecology","title":"高二生物 — 生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/ecology-adv/ecosystem-ecology","wordCount":2247,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二生物-生态系统\">高二生物 — 生态系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生态系统是生物群落与其生存的无机环境相互作用形成的统一整体。一片森林、一个湖泊、一块农田，乃至整个地球生物圈，都是不同尺度的生态系统。生态系统的核心功能是能量流动和物质循环，理解这两大过程及其内在联系，是生态学的核心课题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生态系统</td>\n<td>生物群落 + 无机环境的统一整体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>能将无机物合成有机物的自养生物（主要是绿色植物）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>直接或间接以生产者为食的异养生物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分解者</td>\n<td>将动植物遗体和排泄物中的有机物分解为无机物的生物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食物链</td>\n<td>生物之间由于食物关系形成的链状结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食物网</td>\n<td>多条食物链交织形成的网状结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-生态系统的组成成分\">一、生态系统的组成成分</h3><p>生态系统由四大成分组成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非生物的物质和能量</td>\n<td>无机环境</td>\n<td>提供物质和能量基础</td>\n<td>阳光、水、空气、矿物质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>生物成分</td>\n<td>将光能固定为有机物中的化学能</td>\n<td>绿色植物、蓝藻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>生物成分</td>\n<td>加速物质循环，调节种群数量</td>\n<td>草食动物、肉食动物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分解者</td>\n<td>生物成分</td>\n<td>将有机物分解为无机物归还环境</td>\n<td>细菌、真菌、蚯蚓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产者是生态系统的基石——没有生产者，就没有能量输入，整个系统无法维持。分解者也不可或缺——没有分解者，有机物无法矿化，物质循环将被阻断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-食物链与食物网\">二、食物链与食物网</h3><p><strong>食物链</strong>描述生物之间的营养关系，起点总是生产者，终点是最高营养级消费者。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>草</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>兔</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>狐</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>鹰</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{草} \\to \\text{兔} \\to \\text{狐} \\to \\text{鹰}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">草</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">兔</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">狐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">鹰</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各营养级的命名：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>生物类型</th>\n<th>营养级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一营养级</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>草</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二营养级</td>\n<td>初级消费者</td>\n<td>兔（草食动物）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三营养级</td>\n<td>次级消费者</td>\n<td>狐（肉食动物）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四营养级</td>\n<td>三级消费者</td>\n<td>鹰（顶级捕食者）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>食物链中不包含分解者（分解者分解所有营养级的遗体）</li>\n<li>一种生物在不同食物链中可能处于不同营养级（如杂食动物）</li>\n<li>食物链一般不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个营养级（能量逐级递减的限制）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>食物网</strong>是多条食物链的交织。食物网越复杂（物种越多、连接越密），生态系统越稳定——因为当某一物种数量减少时，其天敌可以转向其他食物来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-能量流动\">三、能量流动</h3><p>能量在生态系统中沿食物链单向流动、逐级递减。</p>\n<p><strong>能量流动过程（以某营养级为例）：</strong></p>\n<p>一个营养级同化的能量有四条去路：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>呼吸散热</strong>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\% \\sim 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>）——以热能形式散失，不能再被利用</li>\n<li><strong>流向下一营养级</strong>（被捕食）</li>\n<li><strong>流向分解者</strong>（遗体、排泄物被分解）</li>\n<li><strong>暂存于现存量中</strong>（未被利用的活体生物量）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>能量传递效率</strong>：相邻两个营养级之间的能量传递效率一般为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\% \\sim 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>传递效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>下一营养级同化量</mtext><mtext>本营养级同化量</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{传递效率} = \\frac{\\text{下一营养级同化量}}{\\text{本营养级同化量}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传递效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本营养级同化量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下一营养级同化量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着：如果第一营养级（草）固定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000\\,\\text{kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的能量，第二营养级（兔）只能获得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000 \\sim 2000\\,\\text{kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span>，第三营养级（狐）只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>400</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 \\sim 400\\,\\text{kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span>……</p>\n<p>这也解释了为什么食物链很少超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个营养级——到第五营养级时可用能量已不足以维持一个种群的生存。</p>\n<p><strong>能量金字塔</strong>：每个营养级的能量用面积表示，从下到上递减，形成正金字塔形。这是生态系统中唯一不会倒置的金字塔（数量金字塔和生物量金字塔在特殊情况下可能倒置）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-物质循环\">四、物质循环</h3><p>物质（化学元素）在生态系统中循环往复、反复利用，与能量流动不同的是物质循环是全球性的。</p>\n<p><strong>碳循环</strong>：</p>\n<p>碳在无机环境中主要以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 形式存在，在生物体内以有机物形式存在。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>碳的形式变化</th>\n<th>参与者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光合作用</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 有机碳</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化能合成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 有机碳</td>\n<td>硝化细菌等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呼吸作用</td>\n<td>有机碳 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有生物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分解作用</td>\n<td>有机碳 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分解者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃烧</td>\n<td>有机碳（化石燃料） → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>人类活动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;大气中 CO2&quot;] --&gt;|光合作用| B[生产者]&#10;    B --&gt;|食物链| C[消费者]&#10;    B --&gt;|呼吸作用| A&#10;    C --&gt;|呼吸作用| A&#10;    B --&gt;|遗体残骸| D[分解者]&#10;    C --&gt;|遗体排泄物| D&#10;    D --&gt;|分解作用| A&#10;    B --&gt;|地质沉积| E[化石燃料]&#10;    E --&gt;|燃烧| A\">graph TD\n    A[\"大气中 CO2\"] --&gt;|光合作用| B[生产者]\n    B --&gt;|食物链| C[消费者]\n    B --&gt;|呼吸作用| A\n    C --&gt;|呼吸作用| A\n    B --&gt;|遗体残骸| D[分解者]\n    C --&gt;|遗体排泄物| D\n    D --&gt;|分解作用| A\n    B --&gt;|地质沉积| E[化石燃料]\n    E --&gt;|燃烧| A</pre><p>温室效应的本质：人类大量燃烧化石燃料，将地质年代封存的碳以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 形式释放到大气中，打破了碳循环的平衡，导致大气 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度升高，全球气温上升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-信息传递\">五、信息传递</h3><p>生态系统中的信息传递维持着生态系统的稳定性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息类型</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理信息</td>\n<td>光、声、温度、磁场</td>\n<td>萤火虫的闪光求偶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学信息</td>\n<td>化学物质</td>\n<td>蜂王释放信息素抑制工蜂发育</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为信息</td>\n<td>动作、姿态</td>\n<td>蜜蜂的圆形舞/摆尾舞指示食物方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>信息传递在生态系统中的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生命活动的正常进行（如花的颜色吸引传粉者）</li>\n<li>种群的繁殖（求偶行为）</li>\n<li>种间关系的调节（报警信号）</li>\n<li>维持生态系统稳定性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"六-生态系统的稳定性\">六、生态系统的稳定性</h3><p><strong>抵抗力稳定性</strong>：生态系统抵抗外界干扰并保持原状的能力。物种丰富度越高、食物网越复杂，抵抗力稳定性越强。</p>\n<p><strong>恢复力稳定性</strong>：生态系统受到干扰后恢复到原来状态的能力。一般来说，生态系统越简单，恢复力稳定性越强（但抵抗力弱）。</p>\n<p>两者通常呈<strong>负相关</strong>关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生态系统</th>\n<th>抵抗力稳定性</th>\n<th>恢复力稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热带雨林</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>草原</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荒漠</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>提高生态系统稳定性的措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>控制对生态系统的干扰强度（合理利用，不超过自我调节能力）</li>\n<li>对被破坏的生态系统实施相应的物质和能量投入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一条食物链中，如果第一营养级的能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6\\,\\text{kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 的传递效率计算，第四营养级最多能获得多少能量？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在草→兔→狐→鹰的食物链中，如果鹰的数量突然减少，短期内狐和兔的数量分别会如何变化？长期呢？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么碳在生物群落内部以有机物的形式流动，而在生物群落与无机环境之间以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的形式循环？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>人工鱼塘生态系统和天然湖泊生态系统相比，哪个需要更多的人工干预才能维持稳定？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>请分析&quot;能量流动是单向的、逐级递减的&quot;，而&quot;物质循环是全球性的、反复循环的&quot;这两个特点为什么看似矛盾却能统一在生态系统中。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>生物圈二号（Biosphere 2）是 1991 年在美国亚利桑那州建造的一个封闭生态系统实验装置，试图在密封建筑内复制地球生态系统。然而实验仅持续了两年就不得不终止——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度持续下降（微生物分解有机质消耗了大量氧气），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度急剧升高，大多数动物和传粉昆虫死亡。这个代价高昂的实验证明了一点：地球生态系统的平衡之精妙，远超人类目前的理解和模拟能力。</p>\n<p>生态足迹的概念揭示了人类对生态系统的消耗程度。全球平均每人需要约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.7</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>公顷</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.7\\,\\text{公顷}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">公顷</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的生物生产性面积来维持其生活方式，而地球人均只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>公顷</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6\\,\\text{公顷}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">公顷</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的生物承载力——这意味着人类目前的消耗已超出地球承载能力约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>。这一过度消耗正是生物多样性下降、气候变化和资源枯竭的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生态系统由非生物环境、生产者、消费者和分解者四部分组成</li>\n<li>食物链和食物网描述营养关系，是能量流动和物质循环的渠道</li>\n<li>能量沿食物链单向流动、逐级递减，传递效率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\% \\sim 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>物质（以碳循环为代表）在生态系统中循环往复，全球范围内流动</li>\n<li>生态系统稳定性包括抵抗力稳定性和恢复力稳定性，二者一般负相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二生物 — 生态系统","id":"高二生物-生态系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、生态系统的组成成分","id":"一-生态系统的组成成分"},{"level":3,"text":"二、食物链与食物网","id":"二-食物链与食物网"},{"level":3,"text":"三、能量流动","id":"三-能量流动"},{"level":3,"text":"四、物质循环","id":"四-物质循环"},{"level":3,"text":"五、信息传递","id":"五-信息传递"},{"level":3,"text":"六、生态系统的稳定性","id":"六-生态系统的稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二生物 — 群落生态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/ecology-adv/community-ecology"},"next":{"title":"高二生物 — 基因工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/genetic-engineering"}}